OL,3,GNEWSAPolice given more to question
OL,4,Adouble murder suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been given extra time to
OL,7,Fquestion a man who was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of murder after two people
OL,9,Fwere found dead in a house in
OL,10,FBlackburn.
OL,12,FIsmail Ahmed Leli, 80, and Fatima Leli,
OL,13,F78, were found with stab wounds at a
OL,14,Fhouse in Hardman Street at about 08:20
OL,15,FBST on Monday.
OL,17,FLancashire Police launched a murder
OL,18,Finvestigation and arrested a man in his
OL,19,F40s.
OL,21,FPaying tribute, the family described
OL,22,Fthe couple as "inseparable".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
